# A fox and a flock in a walled pen (the built-in kinds, rules/): a dozen
# hens graze the meadow and the seeds, drink at the pond and lay eggs; a fox
# in the middle wakes hungry, stalks them and eats where the flock is thick.
# The hens flee it, so the hunt is a chase round the pond.
#
#   make run ARGS="play saves/fox_pen --scenario scenarios/fox_pen_showcase.scenario"
seed 1
outside rock
map {
  ################################################
