  #....,.s.......,...........~~~~~~~~~~~~~,.,....#
  #....................,......~~~~~~~~~~~....s..,#
  #...,s.,...........,.........~~~~~~~~~.........#
  #...........,.,..s.,..#..............,.....,...#
  #........,,.,,.,,.......................#......#
  #,....,,...,,,.,,,,.....,......,............,..#
